    {
      "name": "custom_triu",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "same as reference step",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as x"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = torch.triu(x)",
        "将输入张量视为二维矩阵，保留主对角线及以上元素，主对角线以下元素置零",
        "保持输入的形状、dtype 和 device",
        "支持任意 stride 的输入，通过连续化处理"
      ]
    }
